    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6-a12">

                <pb facs="0127" n="19" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg19"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No. 13.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Schlessing to Mr.
                            Grant.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate-General of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1893-05-26"><hi rendition="#italic">May 26,
                                1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor very respectfully to refer
                    to my communication respecting the seizure by the imperial and royal authorities
                    of John Benich, a naturalized American citizen, and inclose herewith another
                    communication on the same subject, which has been sent by the consular agent at
                    Fiume to this consulate-general.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Schlessing.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
